3	32	2024-04-07 11:55:01.343867	16	MESSAGE	Dear Leszek, I will also attend the Hydrogen Summit. Please send your contact details to my "normal" account which is:  rolfschicke@onlinehome.de  Then we can easily discuss, Best regards, Rolf 	0
4	33	2024-04-07 12:05:36.696816	16	MESSAGE	Dear Attila, I will also attend the Hydrogen Summit. Please send your contact details to my "normal" account which is:  rolfschicke@onlinehome.de  Then we can easily discuss. My background is 20+ years of experience with hydrogen technologies and concepts (PEM fuel cells, high pressure alkaline electrolysis, power-to-x technologies, developing regions with respect to hydrogen production, distribution and use). Also design of hydrogen filling stations for trucks. We also initiated a network of partners working on hydrogen combustion engines which do have a number of advantages compared to fuel cell propulsion systems in terms of cost, requirements regarding the purity of the hydrogen provided and more. Looking forward to meet on the conference.  Best regards, Rolf 	0
5	34	2024-04-07 12:09:21.098878	16	MESSAGE	Hallo Herr Palotas, ich werde aller Voraussicht auch am Mittwoch in Budapest auf dem "Hydrogen Summit" sein. Arbeite seit ca. 20 Jahren im Bereich der H2-Technologien, Konzepte etc. In den letzten beiden Jahren zwei HyExpert-Projekte bearbeitet und gut vernetzt. Freue mich auf einen Austausch .., BG, Rolf Schicke  	0
6	35	2024-04-07 12:11:18.274813	16	MESSAGE	Dear Dejan, I will also attend the Hydrogen Summit. Please send your contact details to my "normal" account which is:  rolfschicke@onlinehome.de  Then we can easily discuss. My background is 20+ years of experience with hydrogen technologies and concepts (PEM fuel cells, high pressure alkaline electrolysis, power-to-x technologies, developing regions with respect to hydrogen production, distribution and use). Also design of hydrogen filling stations for trucks. We also initiated a network of partners working on hydrogen combustion engines which do have a number of advantages compared to fuel cell propulsion systems in terms of cost, requirements regarding the purity of the hydrogen provided and more.  We also worked together with partners on hydrogen infrastructure including high pressure hydrogen pipelines in real estate areas / companies   Looking forward to meet on the conference.  Best regards, Rolf	0
