0	VENUE	The venue of the conference is Hotel Marriott Budapest (Budapest, District V, Apáczai Csere János Street 4). The conference takes place in the Liz Ballroom on the first floor.	2024-03-01 16:38:02.031	t	2
1	PARKING	Please note that we cannot guarantee parking space. Parking in the hotel's underground garage and the surrounding streets is limited.	2024-03-01 16:38:02.031	t	2
2	AGENDA	You can view the professional program and speakers of the 5th Budapest LNG Summit in the app.	2024-03-01 16:38:02.031	t	2
3	ARRIVAL, REGISTRATION	Registration begins at 8:15. The day before the conference, we send you a personalized QR code, which you will need to present to our hostesses upon arrival. Please bring the email containing the QR code printed out or on your phone! Upon arrival, please proceed to the registration desk located on the first floor, where you will be identified based on the QR code, and then you can collect your conference badge from the hostesses. Registration is available throughout the event. You can take your seat in the Liz Ballroom from 8:50 onwards, we welcome you with coffee and morning refreshments until then. Please arrive on time to avoid queuing. We start the program on time. If you are also attending the Budapest Hydrogen Summit the next day, please note that you will have to register again. You will receive a separate QR code for that, which you will need to present upon arrival.	2024-03-01 16:38:02.031	t	2
4	COFFEE BREAK, LUNCH	Throughout the conference, coffee, refreshments, and lunch will be provided. Lunch will be served in the Foyer M and View 3-4 rooms on the first floor.	2024-03-01 16:38:02.031	t	2
5	NETWORKING PARTY	The Budapest LNG Summit is a unique opportunity to meet new partners and expand your network. Don't miss the Networking Reception after the conference, which will take place in the View 7-8 rooms on the ground floor starting from 16:30.	2024-03-01 16:38:02.031	t	2
6	DRESS CODE	The dress code for the event programs is Business formal.	2024-03-01 16:38:02.031	t	2
