11	ARRIVAL, REGISTRATION	Registration begins at 8:15. We will send you a personalized QR code before the conference, which you will need to present to our hostesses upon arrival. Please bring the email containing the QR code printed out or present it on your phone! Upon arrival, please proceed to the registration desk located on the first floor, where you will be identified based on the QR code, then you can collect your conference badge from the hostesses. Registration is available throughout the event. You can take your seat in the Liz Ballroom from 8:50 onwards, we welcome you with coffee and morning refreshments until then. Please arrive on time to avoid queuing. We start the program on time! Please note that if you are also attending the Budapest LNG Summit the previous day, you will receive a separate QR code for that event. You need to present your QR code and register on both days upon arrival.	2024-03-01 16:38:02.031	t	3
